Linda's Easy Potato Bread

280 g. all-purpose flour
3 T    potato flakes
3 T    powdered milk
1 t    salt
1 T    sugar
1 T    butter
7/8 c  water
1.25 t yeast
  

Pizza Dough

480 g all-purpose flour (maybe 420 g)
1 t   salt
2 T   olive oil
1 T   sugar
1 c   water
2 t   yeast

Sesame seed bread

280 g flour (all-purpose + whole wheat)
1 t    salt
14 g   honey
14 g   oil
3 T    sesame seeds
2 T    powdered milk
7/8 c  water (include 1 egg)
1.25 t yeast
